.mdx","Use Lamassu as SaaS","Consume Lamassu as a managed service without operating your own infrastructure.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-71/deployment/saas",{"_70":441},"deployment/saas.mdx","en:deployment",{"_201":444},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-71/images/kubernetes.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-71/images/kubernetes.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_52":53,"_47":447,"_54":55,"_56":-7,"_57":448,"_59":-7,"_49":449,"_45":455,"_68":456,"_66":458},"Upgrades","Version-to-version operator guide",[450],{"_45":451,"_52":63,"_47":37,"_57":452,"_66":-7,"_12":36,"_68":453},"en:upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","What changes in the 4.0.0 architecture, which changes break a 3.8.0 deployment, how to upgrade a Helm release step by step and how to validate the result.",{"_70":454},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","en:upgrades",{"_201":457},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-arrow-up shrink-0 text-[#c8861f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 12-4-4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16V8\"></path></svg>",{"_45":460,"_52":63,"_47":461,"_57":462,"_66":-7,"_12":463,"_68":464},"en:security.mdx","Security","How to report a security vulnerability in Lamassu privately, what to include in a report and which releases receive security fixes.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-71/security",{"_70":465},"security.mdx","fallback"]
